{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Oh, a bus. Wow, is that Yip Kai-foon? He escaped prison—Yip Kai-foon. No way. What’s Yip Kai-foon’s escape got to do with people?"}],"id":"056beef2fb706f1c","jyutping":"ai3 pun4 ce1 aa3。waa3 hai6 m4 hai6 jip6 gai3 fun1 ne1？tou4 juk6，jip6 gai3 fun1 wo3。aa1 mou5 lei5 jau4 aa1，jip6 gai3 fun1 tou4 gwaan1 di1 jan4 caa1 si6 aa4。","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"哎盤車啊。嘩係唔係葉繼歡呢？逃獄，葉繼歡喎。吖冇理由吖，葉繼歡逃關啲人叉事呀。","words":[{"jyutping":"ai3","pos":"e","text":"哎"},{"jyutping":"pun4","pos":"v","text":"盤"},{"jyutping":"ce1","pos":"n","text":"車"},{"jyutping":"aa3","pos":"y","text":"啊"},{"jyutping":"waa3","pos":"e","text":"嘩"},{"jyutping":"hai6","pos":"v","text":"係"},{"jyutping":"m4 hai6","pos":"v","text":"唔係"},{"jyutping":"jip6","pos":"nr","text":"葉"},{"jyutping":"gai3 fun1","pos":"nr","text":"繼歡"},{"jyutping":"ne1","pos":"y","text":"呢"},{"jyutping":"tou4 juk6","pos":"v","text":"逃獄"},{"jyutping":"jip6","pos":"nr","text":"葉"},{"jyutping":"gai3 fun1","pos":"nr","text":"繼歡"},{"jyutping":"wo3","pos":"y","text":"喎"},{"jyutping":"aa1","pos":"y","text":"吖"},{"jyutping":"mou5","pos":"v1","text":"冇"},{"jyutping":"lei5 jau4","pos":"n","text":"理由"},{"jyutping":"aa1","pos":"y","text":"吖"},{"jyutping":"jip6","pos":"nr","text":"葉"},{"jyutping":"gai3 fun1","pos":"nr","text":"繼歡"},{"jyutping":"tou4","pos":"v","text":"逃"},{"jyutping":"gwaan1","pos":"v","text":"關"},{"jyutping":"di1","pos":"q","text":"啲"},{"jyutping":"jan4","pos":"n","text":"人"},{"jyutping":"caa1","pos":"d1","text":"叉"},{"jyutping":"si6","pos":"n","text":"事"},{"jyutping":"aa4","pos":"y","text":"呀"}]}
